<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/$1.00 off - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/$1.00 off - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers slow, steady to $1.00 lower in a narrow test. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs 64.00-66.00. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 63.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 62.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1200 lbs 64.00-65.50. Select and Choice 2-3 975-1100 lbs 63.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 61.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
